{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n伊藤純奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/24/6197748/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も浴衣の写真から！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/24/6197748/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー、初日の大阪3公演が\n無事終了しました(・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/24/6197748/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香さんが欠席でしたが、\nなんかねすごい玲香さんに\n会いたくなったヽ(；▽；)ノ\n玲香さんの存在の大きさを\n実感しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日目の昼と2日目の昼は\nポニーテールで2日目の夜だけ\nハーフアップでした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/24/6197748/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目の昼のかりんちゃん進行MCでは\nちーちゃん、さゆちゃん、あやねと\nアイス早食い対決をしました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は3位！びみょう(^｡^)\n冷たすぎてその後の2曲くらい\n口の中がひんやりしてたよ...。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目の夜公演では\nまひろさんのハッピーバースデーの\nケーキをサプライズで♫\nおめでとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、発表がありましたが\nアンダーライブが中国地方で\n開催される事が決まりました！！！\n9月22.23.24日です！\nぜひ！きてください！待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの時の\nタオルやうちわ、サイリウム、\nしっかり見えてます！ほんとうに\nありがとう(T_T)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は名古屋です！\n盛り上がっていこうーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あとね、\nあすかちゃん！だーーいすきー！！\n(唐突な告白)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎B.L.T発売中です！\n全員浴衣♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/24/6197748/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/24/6197748/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてね(・ω・)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nおやすみなさーい！"}],"source":"archive"}